CURSOR:
   The cursor is the highlighted area with the small, flashing underline
   character in its first column.  By using the cursor keys this  cursor
   may be moved. 

KEY USE:
   [CURSOR UP/ DOWN]    move cursor ONE FIELD up or down. 
   [PAGE UP/ DOWN]      move cursor ONE PAGE up or down.
   [HOME]               To move cursor to TOP of list.
   [END]                To move cursor to BOTTOM of list.

   [ESC]                Will terminate MENU SELECTION PROGRAM
   [ENTER] ([RETURN])   Will activate the currently selected FPP program.
                        On exit from the FPP program, the MENU SELECTION
                        PROGRAM is re-entered. 
   F1                   To select this (help (?)) page.





NOTE:	the HELP TEXT consists of 21 LINES @ 75 CHARACTERS
	any text exceeding these limits is ignored!
